{"id":2443581,"name":"Pixel Art Game UI Icons | Inventory & Item Icons LoRA (Illustrious)","description":"<h2 id=\"pixelart-ui-icons-or-illustrious-lora\">PixelArt UI Icons | Illustrious LoRA</h2><p><strong>PixelArt UI Icons</strong> is a LoRA designed for the <strong>Illustrious model</strong> to generate <strong>high-quality pixel art UI icons for games</strong>. It specializes in creating small, clean, readable icons suitable for <strong>inventories, items, abilities, potions, food, and other RPG-style interface elements</strong>.</p><p>The style focuses on <strong>classic retro game aesthetics</strong>, with sharp pixel edges, strong color contrast, and simple but expressive shapes that work well at small sizes.</p><hr /><h2 id=\"features\">Features</h2><ul><li><p>Retro <strong>pixel art game UI style</strong></p></li><li><p>Perfect for <strong>inventory items and interface icons</strong></p></li><li><p>Clean <strong> 32x32, 64x64 style readability</strong></p></li><li><p>Works great for <strong>RPG, survival, fantasy, and crafting games</strong></p></li><li><p>Consistent <strong>pixel shading and outlines</strong></p></li></ul><hr /><h2 id=\"trigger-word\">Trigger Word</h2><p><code>pixelarticon</code></p><hr /><h2 id=\"recommended-settings\">Recommended Settings</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Model:</strong> Illustrious</p></li><li><p><strong>LoRA Weight:</strong> 0.8 – 1.0</p></li><li><p><strong>Steps:</strong> 8-10</p></li><li><p><strong>CFG:</strong> 5–7</p></li></ul><hr /><h2 id=\"pixel-perfect-generation-(important)\">Pixel Perfect Generation (Important)</h2><p>To get <strong>clean pixel-perfect icons</strong>, generate at higher resolution and <strong>downscale</strong>:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Generate at 512×512 → Downscale to 32×32</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Generate at 1024×1024 → Downscale to 64×64</strong></p></li></ul><p>This preserves <strong>sharp pixels and proper shading</strong> when resizing.</p><p>Use <strong>Nearest Neighbor scaling</strong> when resizing to keep the pixel art crisp.</p><hr /><h2 id=\"example-prompt\">Example Prompt</h2><pre><code>pixelarticon, pixelart, bottle of potion with brown top and green liquid, potion, white background, simple background, isolated, 2d, flat, no shadow, ui element</code></pre><hr /><h2 id=\"best-use-cases\">Best Use Cases</h2><ul><li><p>Game <strong>inventory items</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Crafting materials</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Food icons</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Potions and consumables</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>RPG UI assets</strong></p></li></ul><p></p>","allowNoCredit":true,"allowCommercialUse":["RentCivit"],"allowDerivatives":false,"allowDifferentLicense":true,"type":"LORA","minor":false,"sfwOnly":false,"poi":false,"nsfw":false,"nsfwLevel":1,"availability":"Public","userId":2162421,"hasActivePaidAccess":false,"baseModels":["Illustrious"],"cosmetic":null,"supportsGeneration":true,"stats":{"downloadCount":977,"thumbsUpCount":72,"thumbsDownCount":0,"commentCount":0,"tippedAmountCount":20},"creator":{"username":"YoDaR2","image":"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bc3946f7-80fa-4ed4-ac22-251960926151/width=96/YoDaR2.jpeg"},"tags":["pixelart","style","game-assets","sprite","game-ui","pixel-art","retro","icons","pixel art","ui","rpg","items","pixel-ui","game-dev","inventory-icons","indie-game","game-icons"],"modelVersions":[{"id":2747471,"index":0,"name":"v1.0","baseModel":"Illustrious","baseModelType":"Standard","createdAt":"2026-03-05T22:42:07.899Z","publishedAt":"2026-03-05T22:45:38.036Z","status":"Published","flags":0,"availability":"Public","nsfwLevel":1,"trainedWords":["pixelarticon"],"covered":true,"stats":{"downloadCount":977,"thumbsUpCount":72,"thumbsDownCount":0},"files":[{"id":2633960,"sizeKB":223110.79296875,"name":"PixelArt_Icon_IL_M_V2.1_00002.safetensors.safetensors","overrideName":null,"type":"Model","pickleScanResult":"Success","pickleScanMessage":"No Pickle imports","virusScanResult":"Success","virusScanM